These are worked examples of the current Gaoshou engine, reconstructed from legacy Wuxia Styles. Legacy abilities not represented by the current construction are not automatically retained. Style Shido are intentionally left blank for a later institutional pass. Each example's listed Additional Gaoshou Affinity is its Duan Wei 2 Affinity; its underlying Mundane Martial Art must supply a different ST-or-HT Affinity so the final pair obeys the Wuxia Affinity Pair Rule.
